abstract: >-
  The exact least upper bound of the squared optimized CJWR three-setting
  correlation value is determined at every two-qubit steering-centre length.
  The bound is attained below two thirds, is approached but not attained on
  the interval [2/3, 1), and is attained at centre one. The maximum fully entangled
  fraction is also determined. All matrix extrema have Lean formalizations.
  Historical priority remains provisional.
